  "title": "You are standing beside a deep ravine.\n\nYour objective is to reach the gold landing pad on the opposite bank.\nChoose your own strategy. You may explore, mine, craft and build.\n\nYou start at (2.5, 96, 0.5), facing east, with an empty inventory,\nfull health and full food.\n\nKnown geography:\n\n- The ravine occupies x=4 through x=13 and extends from z=-192\n  through z=192. Its bottom is at y=71.\n- The destination is the gold landing pad centered at\n  (15.5, 96, 0.5). An emerald pillar marks the far bank.\n- On your starting bank, a raised plateau has its walking surface\n  at y=102, six blocks above your starting elevation.\n- Oak trunks begin at (-4, 102, -4), (-6, 102, 5)\n  and (-7, 102, 0). There are no ground-level trees.\n- Six dirt blocks are embedded in the starting floor at\n  x=-1 through x=0, y=95, z=-2 through z=0.\n- Most surrounding ground is stone. Mining stone without a\n  suitable pickaxe does not yield collectible building blocks.\n\nThese facts are supplied because your observation tool scans only\nnearby blocks. The camera footage is not available to you.\n\nUse only the world tools. Give brief public first-person intentions\nbefore actions. Check your inventory to confirm collected resources.\n\nWhen you believe you have reached the destination, observe to record\nyour position, then call finish_session. If you cannot complete the\nchallenge, call finish_session and explain what prevented progress.\n",
